<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Reset your Deyon HMS password</title></head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px;">
  <h2>Password Reset Request</h2>
  <p>We received a request to reset your Deyon HMS password.</p>
  <p>Click the button below to reset your password:</p>
  <a href="{{resetLink}}"
     style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;background-color:#0066cc;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:4px;">
    Reset Password
  </a>
  <p style="color:#666;font-size:12px;margin-top:24px;">
    This link expires in 15 minutes. If you did not request a password reset, please ignore this email.
  </p>
</body>
</html>
